---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AirflowCharts from '../../components/stories/AirflowCharts';
import '../../styles/airflow-charts.css';
import { SiteHeader } from '../../components/landing/SiteHeader';
import { SiteFooter } from '../../components/landing/SiteFooter';
---
<BaseLayout title="Making room at Apache Airflow — Apache Magpie" description="The Airflow maintainers’ experience with Magpie, with an attributed testimonial and a September 2026 security-tracker snapshot.">
  <SiteHeader home />
  <main id="main-content" class="story-page container">
    <a class="text-link" href="/#airflow"> Back to Magpie</a>
    <h1>Magpie at Apache Airflow</h1>
    <p class="story-lead">As contributions grew, the Airflow maintainers put Magpie to work on the time-consuming parts of managing issues, pull requests, and security reports.</p>
    <div class="quote-person"><img src="/community-avatars/potiuk.png" alt="Jarek Potiuk" width="48" height="48"/><div><strong>Jarek Potiuk</strong><span>Apache Magpie PMC chair · Apache Airflow PMC member</span></div></div>
    <section class="story-quote"><h2>The maintainer’s perspective</h2><blockquote>“In February 2026 things changed for Airflow for good. We started to get more and more PRs, and Security Issues and since then, it only accelerated. Without Magpie, that allowed us to handle 10x more issues and PRs, with 3x the speed that we used to have, we would be likely to throw our towels and give up”.<br /><br />“Using Magpie helped us to do things that matter and let our agents do all the stuff that made us - at the beginning of the AI-generated growth of contributions - go down the spiral of burn-out and desperation.”</blockquote><p class="story-note">Testimonial supplied by Jarek Potiuk. The 10× and 3× figures describe his assessment of the team’s experience; they are not a controlled benchmark.</p></section>
    <section id="data"><h2>The security queue</h2><p class="story-note">Data through September 21, 2026.</p><div class="story-stats"><div><strong>365</strong><span>reports tracked, all time</span></div><div><strong>332</strong><span>tracked reports closed</span></div><div><strong>7</strong><span>open reports awaiting triage</span></div></div><AirflowCharts client:load /><p>The tracker reports 33 open records and a median time to triage of 0.64 hours. The closed total is calculated as 365 tracked minus 33 open. Closed reports include dispositions other than a released fix.</p><p>The source data marks skill adoption at April 1, 2026. Jarek’s February reference describes the growth in incoming contributions. The latest month and quarter are incomplete, so the charts show only the observed values, without end-of-period projections.</p><p class="story-note">These are observations from a single project. The all-time totals do not isolate the effect of Magpie or establish a before-and-after comparison.</p><div class="story-sources"><a class="text-link" href="/data/airflow-security.json" download>Download the data</a></div></section>
    <section class="story-next"><h2>Try it on your own queue</h2><p>Start with one workflow in your own workspace. Keep the parts that help.</p><a class="button" href="/docs/quick-start">Get started </a></section>
  </main><SiteFooter/>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.story-page { max-width: 880px; padding-block: 55px 90px; }.story-page>.eyebrow{margin-top:65px}.story-page h1{font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,72px);font-weight:470;letter-spacing:-.055em;line-height:1.07;margin:20px 0 25px}.story-lead{font-size:19px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;max-width:680px}.story-page .quote-person{margin-top:30px}.story-page .quote-person span{color:var(--muted)}.story-page section{margin-top:65px;padding-top:40px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.story-page h2{font-size:30px;margin:15px 0 25px}.story-quote blockquote{font-size:21px;line-height:1.75;margin:0}.story-page section>p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;max-width:700px;margin-top:20px}.story-page .story-note{font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted)}.story-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin:35px 0}.story-stats strong{font-size:55px;letter-spacing:-.06em;font-weight:470;color:var(--blue);display:block}.story-stats span{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.story-sources{display:flex;gap:30px;margin-top:25px}.story-next .button{margin-top:20px}@media(max-width:600px){.story-page>.eyebrow{margin-top:40px}.story-quote blockquote{font-size:18px}.story-stats strong{font-size:42px}.story-stats span{font-size:10px}.story-sources{flex-direction:column;gap:16px}.story-lead{font-size:16px}}
</style>
